### Requests for trying the API by hand.
### In IntelliJ, click the green ▶ next to a request to send it. The app must be running (the "Grails App" run config).
### Each round adds its new endpoints here.

### Health check: should return {"message":"pong","environment":"development"}
GET http://localhost:9030/api/ping

### Unknown URL: should return a JSON 404
GET http://localhost:9030/api/does-not-exist
